---
title: "parse_price_feed_message (Pyth Sui Contracts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_type: message_type = deserialize_u8(message_cur)
    q_type --> q_check: message_type == PRICE_FEED_MESSAGE_TYPE
    q_check --> q_abort: false, abort E_INVALID_UPDATE_DATA
    q_check --> q_deser: true
    q_deser --> q_fields: deserialize price_identifier(32), price(i64), conf(u64), expo(i32), publish_time(u64)
    q_fields --> q_skip: skip prev_publish_time(i64)
    q_skip --> q_ema: deserialize ema_price(i64), ema_conf(u64)
    q_ema --> q_build: build PriceInfo with clock_ms/1000 as arrival_time
    q_build --> [*]: return price_info

    note right of q_build
        INV-001: message_type must be PRICE_FEED_MESSAGE_TYPE (0)
        INV-002: arrival_time uses clock_ms/1000 (milliseconds to seconds)
        INV-003: attestation_time also set to clock_ms/1000 for backward compat
    end note
